s/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage at the end of its turn.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Her_Voice:_Transforming\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Her_Voice:_Transforming_(Condition)\" title=\"Her Voice: Transforming (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Her Voice: Transforming\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Her_Voice_Transforming_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Her_Voice:_Transforming_(Condition)\" title=\"Her Voice: Transforming (Condition)\">Her Voice: Transforming</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity's brain is being tortured at the whim of the Absolute. It receives a -2 penalty to Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Scores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Scores\">Abilities</a> and takes <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w